        },
        "labels": [],
        "state": "closed",
        "locked": false,
        "assignee": null,
        "assignees": [],
        "milestone": null,
        "comments": 1,
        "created_at": "2021-07-15T21:28:38Z",
        "updated_at": "2021-07-16T17:00:23Z",
        "closed_at": "2021-07-16T17:00:23Z",
        "author_association": "NONE",
        "active_lock_reason": null,
        "draft": false,
        "pull_request": {
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/discord/ColorPicker/pulls/2",
          "merged_at": "2021-07-16T17:00:23Z"
        },
        "body": "**Figma**: https://www.figma.com/file/lmWjzOAMnEhQS6iVqDmlGV/%E2%9C%85-Custom-Profiles-All-Platforms?node-id=2260%3A105463\r\n\r\nTo match our designs in Figma, this PR is\r\n1) removing the border around the color panel (the color circle)\r\n2) removing 16dp of extra padding between the color-hex input and the \"select\" button. There's already a 16dp margin above the \"select\" button, so if we were to keep this padding, it'd make the total spacing 32dp which doesn't match our designs.\r\n\r\nI confirmed with product design that we want to remove the color panel border for the role color picker as well.\r\n\r\n| Before | After |\r\n| -- | -- |\r\n| ![before](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/3821698/125860170-174677ce-a035-4f4d-9429-b2358b81b977.png) | ![after](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/3821698/125860214-db373f88-9b22-41cf-b0d4-ec4ce4db573f.png) |\r\n\r\n",
        "reactions": {
